    "title": "Measuring Employee Performance by GitHub Commits: Why It’s Misguided",
    "mediumUrl": "https://medium.com/@sd2b/measuring-employee-performance-by-github-commits-why-its-misguided-1c28bc0d85c9",
    "date": "Dec 05, 2024",
